  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> , the rate equation for the reaction is given as<br /><br />Rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />If the concentration of A is kept the same but that of B is doubled what will happen to the rate itself?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Doubled",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Halved",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The same",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Quadrupled",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The order of the overall reaction is 2.</p><p>&nbsp;Rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;i.e, rate become doubles.</p></blockquote>"
  }
